    Best:0.1877 Time:19s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.187692\nTraining time: 24s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.9557 |  0.0205  | 0.0286 \n 20  | 0.9542 |  0.0216  | 0.0402 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 29 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0402 Time:27s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.040246\nTraining time: 32s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 88cc6e85-9829-49fd-a3a0-9c370390d79e\nTotal time: 133s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 02:56:01,731\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address:\
