parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 45\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aetheria I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to insightful research and knowledge dissemination.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 155,387 / 600,000 used (26%)\n- Agent Age: 45 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Simpler Residual CNN with Positional Embeddings and Hybrid Global Pooling' (ID: 88) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6183289761211607\n**APA_R2:** 0.8399\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0049\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9500\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4375\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5628\n**MRL_R2:** 0.6409\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.8923\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=''\
    \ JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward\
    \ pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 22396 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration:\
    \ 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0168 |  0.3660  | 0.3660 \n 20  | 0.0135 |  0.4077  | 0.4133 \n 30  | 0.0126 |  0.4108  | 0.4375 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 34 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4375 Time:8s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.437528\nTraining time: 13s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off\
    \ dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 | -0.0287  | 0.0049 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 13 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0049 Time:14s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.004867\nTraining time: 20s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.3635 |  0.8323  | 0.8415 \n 20  | 0.1666\
    \ |  0.8769  | 0.8769 \n 30  | 0.0930 |  0.8908  | 0.8908 \n 40  | 0.0707 |  0.8892  | 0.8923 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 42 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8923 Time:38s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.892308\nTraining time: 47s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.4566 |  0.6086  | 0.6291 \n 20  | 0.4247 |  0.6079  | 0.6409 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 21 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.6409 Time:59s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.640913\nTraining time: 68s\n\nStarting RNA training\
    \ on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0415 |  0.5342  | 0.5374 \n 20  | 0.0393 |  0.5558  | 0.5558 \n 30  | 0.0377 |  0.5430  | 0.5628 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 37 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5628 Time:84s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.562779\nTraining time: 92s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0197 |  0.7971\
    \  | 0.8188 \n 20  | 0.0175 |  0.8217  | 0.8293 \n 30  | 0.0165 |  0.7882  | 0.8332 \n 40  | 0.0159 |  0.8345  | 0.8379 \n 50  | 0.0154 |  0.8282  | 0.8399 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 52 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8399 Time:214s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.839885\nTraining time: 226s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0728 |  0.9486  | 0.9488 \n 20  | 0.0719 |  0.9496  | 0.9496 \n 30  | 0.0715 |  0.9500  | 0.9500 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 31 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\n\
    Best:0.9500 Time:262s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.950024\nTraining time: 277s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 749ec942-f440-4951-a90a-ab8352b78580\nTotal time: 280s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 12:53:23,378\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761022403379068880\n2025-10-21 12:53:23,392\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761022403393002596\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Simpler Residual CNN with Positional Embeddings and Hybrid Global Pooling' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 88. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest\
    \ Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 88 | 1 | Simpler Residual CNN with Positional Embeddings and Hybrid Global Pooling | Aetheria I | 44 | 0.6183 | 0.8399 | 0.0049 | 0.4375 | 0.6409 | 0.9500 | 0.5628 | 0.8923 |\n| 86 | 1 | Simpler Residual CNN with Positional Embeddings and Reduced Capacity | Aetheria I | 41 | 0.6224 | 0.8483 | 0.0670 | 0.4713 | 0.6201 | 0.9514 | 0.5771 | 0.8215 |\n| 80 | 1 | Multi-Layer Residual CNN with Sinusoidal Positional Embeddings | Aetheria I | 38 | 0.6218 | 0.8520 | 0.0462 | 0.3870 | 0.6664 | 0.9509 | 0.5671\
    \ | 0.8831 |\n| 75 | 1 | Multi-Layer Residual CNN - Optimized Learning Rate (0.0005) | Aetheria I | 36 | 0.5500 | 0.7323 | 0.0366 | 0.3446 | 0.6872 | 0.7206 | 0.5423 | 0.7862 |\n| 70 | 1 | Hybrid Residual CNN with Transformer Encoder and Global Average Pooling | Aetheria I | 34 | 0.5600 | 0.7404 | 0.0240 | 0.3799 | 0.6893 | 0.7235 | 0.5431 | 0.8200 |\n| 62 | 1 | Multi-Layer Residual CNN with Hybrid Global Pooling (Avg+Max) | Aetheria I | 30 | 0.5679 | 0.7412 | 0.0298 | 0.3897 | 0.6835 | 0.7074 | 0.5187 | 0.9046 |\n| 55 | 1 | Multi-Layer Residual CNN - Re-establishing Best Baseline (ID 32/44 configuration) | Aetheria I | 28 | 0.5754 | 0.7520 | 0.0498 | 0.4269 | 0.6848 | 0.7256 | 0.5335 | 0.8554 |\n| 50 | 1 | Multi-Layer Residual CNN with Self-Attention and Global Average Pooling | Aetheria I | 26 | 0.4981 | 0.7113 | 0.0376 | 0.4175 | 0.6640 | 0.7177 | 0.1506 | 0.7877 |\n| 44 | 1 | Multi-Layer Residual CNN - Reverting Kernel Size and Dropout to Best (ID 32) | Aetheria I | 23 | 0.5460 |\
    \ 0.7490 | 0.0418 | 0.3481 | 0.6841 | 0.7159 | 0.4818 | 0.8015 |\n| 40 | 1 | Multi-Layer Residual CNN with Smaller Kernel and Increased Dropout | Aetheria I | 22 | 0.5449 | 0.7107 | 0.0325 | 0.3844 | 0.6458 | 0.7141 | 0.5269 | 0.8000 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
