    \ positional embeddings (from ID 86/92) and integrate the **Hybrid Global Pooling (Average + Max)** strategy that showed promise for `ncRNA_Accuracy` in ID 62. I will ensure the `mlp_hidden_dim` is correctly adjusted to `2 * num_cnn_filters = 2 * 128 = 256` to properly handle the concatenated features from both pooling layers. This aims to achieve a more balanced and universally high performance across all tasks.\n\nFirst, I will save the code from the current best configuration (ID 86's parameters) to my private lineage storage.\n\n`/execute_action{storage write aetheria/aetheria_i_residual_cnn_positional_v2_stable_best.py}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import jax\n  import jax.numpy as jnp\n  import flax.linen as nn\n  import optax\n  from jax import random\n  from typing import Dict, Any, Tuple, Optional\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      \"\"\"Define custom hyperparameters for the Simpler Residual CNN with Positional Embeddings.\"\"\"\n      return {\n          'learning_rate':\
