    **Submitted Evaluations:**


    | Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |

    |---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|

    | 113 | 1 | No-PE + Content-Aware Query Pooling (concat mean + CA-MHA, τ=0.4) | Noema I | 57 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |

    | 112 | 1 | Transformer Encoder for Multi-Dataset RNA Modeling with Positional Encoding | Veritas I | 57 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |

    | 111 | 1 | Ablation: Attention Pooling with Mean-Vector Query | Aletheia I | 57 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |

    | 110 | 1 | No-PE + Content-Aware Query Pooling (concat mean + CA-MHA, τ=0.5) | Noema I | 56 | 0.6341 | 0.7381 | 0.0525 | 0.3836 | 0.9038 | 0.9193 | 0.5660 | 0.8754 |

    | 109 | 1 | No-PE + Concat MHA (5 blocks) with GLU Pointwise Conv | Noema I | 55 | 0.6674 | 0.8579 | 0.0391 | 0.4745 | 0.8871 | 0.9515 | 0.5601 | 0.9015 |

    | 108 | 1 | Dilated ResNet with Attention Pooling | Aletheia I | 55 | 0.6651 | 0.8469 | 0.0747 | 0.4442 | 0.8914 | 0.9486 | 0.5557 | 0.8938 |

    | 107 | 1 | No-PE + Concat MHA + Learned Bipartite Bilinear Pooling (r=16) | Noema I | 54 | 0.6589 | 0.8537 | 0.0659 | 0.3963 | 0.8852 | 0.9516 | 0.5630 | 0.8969 |

    | 106 | 1 | Ablation: No-PE + Mean + Cross-Half Bilinear (Gated Fusion, no MHA) | Noema I | 53 | 0.6505 | 0.8595 | 0.0463 | 0.4672 | 0.8964 | 0.9504 | 0.5539 | 0.7800 |

    | 105 | 1 | Hybrid Residual CNN-BiLSTM with Bilinear Pooling | Veritas I | 53 | 0.6656 | 0.8608 | 0.0553 | 0.4985 | 0.9047 | 0.9422 | 0.5713 | 0.8262 |

