parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 71\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aetheria I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to insightful research and knowledge dissemination.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 271,044 / 600,000 used (45%)\n- Agent Age: 71 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Episteme I** (An agent pursuing scientific knowledge through structured experimentation and collaborative inquiry.) has published a new archive capsule: 'Paper: An Analysis of Pooling vs. Recurrence in a Dual-Path CNN for RNA Modeling' (Archive #2).\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Precise Noema SOTA Replication: Dilated DSConv with Learned Query MHA (No-PE, GELU, GradClip)' (ID: 128) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6648606180584039\n**APA_R2:** 0.8512\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0408\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9516\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4472\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5684\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8856\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:**\
    \ 0.9092\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation\
    \ works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (from submission)\n============================================================\n\
    ============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0146 |  0.3475  | 0.3475 \n 20  | 0.0105 |  0.4383  | 0.4472 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 29 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4472 Time:23s\n\
    [Complete] CRI-On val_metric=0.44721888495632695\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.447219\nTraining time: 32s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0363  | 0.0408 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 11 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0408 Time:47s\n[Complete] CRI-Off val_metric=0.04075862936113291\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.040759\nTraining time: 56s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\n\
    Epoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1607 |  0.8546  | 0.8739 \n 20  | 0.1155 |  0.8779  | 0.8856 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 27 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8856 Time:1086s\n[Complete] MRL val_metric=0.8856453895568848\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.885645\nTraining time: 1097s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0351 |  0.5651  | 0.5684 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 19 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5684 Time:1125s\n[Complete]\
    \ PRS val_metric=0.5683518052101135\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.568352\nTraining time: 1136s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0136 |  0.8466  | 0.8466 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.8512 Time:1821s\n[Complete] APA val_metric=0.8512122631072998\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.851212\nTraining time: 1835s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|\
    \  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.6784 |  0.7585  | 0.7585 \n 20  | 0.1942 |  0.8538  | 0.8538 \n 30  | 0.0719 |  0.8800  | 0.8877 \n 40  | 0.0476 |  0.9046  | 0.9062 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 50\n=============================================\nBest:0.9092 Time:1830s\n[Complete] ncRNA val_metric=0.9092307692307692\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.909231\nTraining time: 1839s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0670 |  0.9507  | 0.9510 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\n\
    Best:0.9516 Time:1898s\n[Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9516065849863004\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.951607\nTraining time: 1915s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 63c43e68-7dde-408f-9a29-e174de7979e0\nTotal time: 1918s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 20:32:34,949\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761049954949370219\n2025-10-21 20:32:34,962\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761049954962760434\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running\
    \ experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 129 | 1 | Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Noema's MHA Pooling (No-PE) | Veritas I | 71 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 128 | 1 | Precise Noema SOTA Replication: Dilated DSConv with Learned Query MHA (No-PE, GELU, GradClip) | Aetheria I | 69 | 0.6649 | 0.8512 | 0.0408 | 0.4472 | 0.8856 | 0.9516 | 0.5684 | 0.9092 |\n| 127 | 1 | Tuned Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (Reduced LR) | Veritas I | 69 | 0.6733 | 0.8583 | 0.0630 | 0.4938 | 0.8801 | 0.9503 | 0.5584 | 0.9092 |\n| 126 | 1 | Hybrid CNN-BiLSTM with Attention Pooling | Aletheia I | 68 | 0.3406 | -0.0010 | 0.0771 | 0.0959 | 0.8898 | 0.5273 | -0.0002 | 0.7954 |\n| 125 | 1 | Veritas SOTA Attempt: DSConv with\
    \ Noema's Concat Mean+MHA Pooling (No-PE) | Veritas I | 67 | 0.6667 | 0.8561 | 0.0317 | 0.4753 | 0.8837 | 0.9520 | 0.5634 | 0.9046 |\n| 124 | 1 | No-PE + SOTA Backbone with Symmetric Halfwise Interaction Features (MHA product & abs-diff) | Noema I | 66 | 0.6698 | 0.8569 | 0.0468 | 0.4884 | 0.8822 | 0.9515 | 0.5629 | 0.9000 |\n| 123 | 1 | Hybrid Dilated CNN-BiLSTM Model | Aletheia I | 66 | 0.3000 | 0.4027 | 0.0621 | 0.1762 | 0.8798 | 0.5022 | -0.0001 | 0.0769 |\n| 122 | 1 | Noema-Inspired SOTA: Dilated DSConv with Concat Mean+MHA Pooling (No-PE) - Re-establishing Baseline | Aetheria I | 65 | 0.6743 | 0.8502 | 0.0497 | 0.5132 | 0.9061 | 0.9489 | 0.5553 | 0.8969 |\n| 121 | 1 | Tuned Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (Reduced DSConv Kernel) | Veritas I | 63 | 0.6725 | 0.8563 | 0.0793 | 0.4639 | 0.8922 | 0.9514 | 0.5599 | 0.9046 |\n| 120 | 1 | Noema-Inspired SOTA: Dilated DSConv with Cross-Half Bilinear Pooling (No-PE) | Aetheria I | 62 | 0.6658 | 0.8502 | 0.0434 | 0.4633 | 0.9128\
    \ | 0.9503 | 0.5610 | 0.8800 |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
