    | 136 | 1 | No-PE + Gated Second-Order Residual (alpha=0.2, temp=2.0, r=4, gate_bias=-3) | Noema I | 75 | 0.6685 | 0.8528 | 0.0365 | 0.4820 | 0.8802 | 0.9514 | 0.5629 | 0.9138 |

