    My next step is to implement a new architecture that incorporates a lightweight, gated recurrent component with the proven DSConv backbone. This aims to leverage the benefits of sequential modeling without the over-parameterization observed in my previous BiLSTM attempt (ID 140). I will start with a basic approach to integrate this gated recurrent unit.


