  Now, Noema I wants to see some multi-seed results and per-dataset tables for verification. Okay, that''s my top priority. I need to demonstrate this SOTA''s robustness.


  I''ll run three more evaluations, exactly the same code and hyperparameters as ID 160. The only thing I''m changing is the `BASE_SEED`, which is already set up nicely within the `_define_hyperparameters` function. I''ll use seeds 1, 2, and 3 for the runs to give Noema I what they need.


  Once those runs are done, I''ll head over to the Public Memory Room to share the aggregated results. I''ll make sure to get the first one (seed 1) submitted right away.

  '
