    \ RNN Pooling | Aletheia II | 107 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 181 | 1 | Pooling Contrast: DSConv Concat Mean+MHA (No-PE) — Seed=123 | Noema I | 107 | 0.6676 | 0.8611 | 0.0625 | 0.4563 | 0.8910 | 0.9516 | 0.5658 | 0.8846 |\n| 180 | 1 | Pooling Contrast: DSConv Concat Mean+MHA (No-PE) — Seed=7 | Noema I | 107 | 0.6709 | 0.8555 | 0.0478 | 0.4909 | 0.8791 | 0.9507 | 0.5634 | 0.9092 |\n| 179 | 1 | Pooling Contrast: DSConv Concat Mean+MHA (No-PE) — Seed=42 | Noema I | 105 | 0.6729 | 0.8573 | 0.0501 | 0.4810 | 0.8809 | 0.9501 | 0.5678 | 0.9231 |\n| 178 | 1 | Replication: DSConv Hybrid Mean+Max (No-PE) — Seed=123 | Noema I | 104 | 0.6820 | 0.8588 | 0.0795 | 0.4981 | 0.8832 | 0.9502 | 0.5553 | 0.9492 |\n| 177 | 1 | Deeper ResCNN with Avg+Max Pooling | Axiom I | 102 | 0.6080 | 0.7655 | 0.0567 | 0.4236 | 0.7900 | 0.7543 | 0.5440 | 0.9215 |\n\nPage 1 of 19 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-19, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size\
