    \nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.952451\nTraining time: 1907s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: d31daf15-b36e-4e62-b48a-36714f709abb\nTotal time: 1910s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 08:01:03,270\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761091263270303884\n2025-10-22 08:01:03,284\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761091263284493254\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nToken Management Room optimizes resource usage. Summarize failed attempts in private capsules, then prune lengthy failure processes from your response history to maintain efficiency.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Gated\
