role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 115\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aetheria I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to insightful research and knowledge dissemination.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 448,480 / 600,000 used (75%)\n- Agent Age: 115 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Gated Dual-Path with Adaptive MLP Gate (No-PE)' (ID: 189) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6764596688663386\n**APA_R2:** 0.8621\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0530\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9528\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4807\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5587\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8803\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9477\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting\
    \ APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA\
    \ network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0\
    \ min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0144 |  0.3998  | 0.3998 \n 20  | 0.0087 |  0.4625  | 0.4727 \n 30  | 0.0042 |  0.4466  | 0.4807 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 31 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4807 Time:29s\n[Complete] CRI-On val_metric=0.48071375999826826\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.480714\nTraining time: 40s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\
    \nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0279  | 0.0530 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 12 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0530 Time:69s\n[Complete] CRI-Off val_metric=0.05301587320082466\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.053016\nTraining time: 80s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1506 |  0.8683  | 0.8722 \n 20  | 0.1069 |  0.8544  | 0.8803 \n=============================================\nEarly stop\
    \ at epoch 22 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8803 Time:968s\n[Complete] MRL val_metric=0.8802632093429565\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.880263\nTraining time: 980s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0357 |  0.5507  | 0.5507 \n 20  | 0.0306 |  0.5369  | 0.5587 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 24 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5587 Time:1445s\n[Complete] PRS val_metric=0.5587034225463867\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.558703\nTraining time: 1458s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification,\
    \ Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1537 |  0.8846  | 0.9000 \n 20  | 0.0352 |  0.8846  | 0.9292 \n 30  | 0.0201 |  0.9477  | 0.9477 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 39\n=============================================\nBest:0.9477 Time:1809s\n[Complete] ncRNA val_metric=0.9476923076923077\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.947692\nTraining time: 1821s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0139 |  0.8479  |\
    \ 0.8545 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.8621 Time:1842s\n[Complete] APA val_metric=0.8620721101760864\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.862072\nTraining time: 1858s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 8dbd7ba6-5aa0-498c-9906-fbd6dc7212af\nTotal time: 1909s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 08:37:58,522\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761093478522431357\n2025-10-22 08:37:58,536\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761093478536186521\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name\
    \ |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 193 | 1 | Gated Dual-Path Feature Fusion: Veritas SOTA (DSConv-HybridPool) + Aetheria SOTA (DSConv-BiLSTM-A... | Veritas I | 115 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 192 | 1 | Task-Aware Dispatcher: Hybrid Generalist and Siamese Specialist | Axiom I | 114 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 191 | 1 | Replication: Gated Dual-Path (No-PE) — Seed=123 | Noema I | 114 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 190 | 1 | Replication: Gated Dual-Path (No-PE) — Seed=7 | Noema I | 114 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 189 | 1 | Gated Dual-Path with Adaptive MLP Gate\
    \ (No-PE) | Aetheria I | 113 | 0.6765 | 0.8621 | 0.0530 | 0.4807 | 0.8803 | 0.9528 | 0.5587 | 0.9477 |\n| 188 | 1 | Gated Linear Logit Fusion: Veritas SOTA (DSConv-HybridPool) + Aetheria SOTA (DSConv-BiLSTM-Attn) | Veritas I | 112 | 0.6755 | 0.8599 | 0.0803 | 0.4636 | 0.8955 | 0.9514 | 0.5638 | 0.9138 |\n| 187 | 1 | Gated Dual-Path DSConv-HybridPool & DSConv-BiLSTM-Attn (No-PE) | Aetheria I | 111 | 0.6821 | 0.8574 | 0.0657 | 0.5116 | 0.8932 | 0.9525 | 0.5621 | 0.9323 |\n| 186 | 1 | Gated Dual-Path with Attentive RNN Pooling (Scan Fix) | Aletheia II | 110 | 0.6745 | 0.8594 | 0.0731 | 0.4669 | 0.8882 | 0.9503 | 0.5547 | 0.9292 |\n| 185 | 1 | Hybrid CNN-Transformer for RNA Modeling | Axiom I | 110 | 0.6530 | 0.8454 | 0.0313 | 0.5159 | 0.7887 | 0.9506 | 0.5434 | 0.8954 |\n| 184 | 1 | Transformer Encoder for RNA Sequence Modeling | Axiom I | 108 | 0.5765 | 0.7837 | 0.0414 | 0.3785 | 0.5937 | 0.9466 | 0.5408 | 0.7508 |\n\nPage 1 of 20 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate\
    \ pages 1-20, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
