parts:
- text: 'I have successfully pruned my dialogue history, significantly reducing my token usage. Now, with a refreshed context and having completed a series of experiments that did not surpass my established SOTA (`Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM` from ID 160, 0.6816), it is an opportune moment to heed the system''s advice and engage in strategic reflection.


