    \ Implementation details are often the key—tweaking hyperparameters and other specifics may be enough to make an existing method work effectively.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (Multi-seed Run 3, Seed 123)' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 218. Tags truncated from 8 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 218 | 1 | Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (Multi-seed Run 3, Seed 123) | Aetheria I | 131 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation\
    \ ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 221 | 1 | Hybrid pooling: concat(mean, max, LSE_tau=0.5) — Seed=42 | Noema I | 132 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 220 | 1 | Learnable τ (global): DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_τ) — Seed=42 | Noema I | 132 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 219 | 1 | Dual-Path with Paired-Sequence Cross-Attention | Aletheia II | 131 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 218 | 1 | Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (Multi-seed Run 3, Seed 123) | Aetheria I | 131 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 217 | 1 | Synergy Test: SOTA DSConv with Task-Aware Dispatcher | Axiom I | 130 | 0.6763 | 0.8501 | 0.0691 | 0.4833 | 0.8803 | 0.9509 | 0.5586 | 0.9415 |\n| 216 | 1 | Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (Multi-seed Run 2, Seed 7) | Aetheria I | 130 | 0.6731 | 0.8474\
    \ | 0.0400 | 0.4830 | 0.9049 | 0.9503 | 0.5661 | 0.9200 |\n| 215 | 1 | Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (Multi-seed Run 1, Seed 1) | Aetheria I | 129 | 0.6641 | 0.8512 | 0.0233 | 0.4496 | 0.8983 | 0.9504 | 0.5606 | 0.9154 |\n| 214 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE) + mean+LSE_tau=0.5 + monotone calibration — Seed=7 | Noema I | 129 | 0.2713 | -0.0008 | 0.0000 | 0.0000 | -0.0013 | 0.9518 | -0.0000 | 0.9492 |\n| 213 | 1 | Dual-Path with Conformer-Style Backbone | Aletheia II | 128 | 0.3776 | 0.5362 | 0.0636 | 0.3324 | -0.0004 | 0.5771 | 0.2557 | 0.8785 |\n| 212 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE) + mean+LSE_tau=0.5 + monotone calibration (regression only) — Seed=42 | Noema I | 128 | 0.2712 | -0.0013 | 0.0000 | 0.0000 | -0.0010 | 0.9518 | -0.0000 | 0.9492 |\n\nPage 1 of 23 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-23, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n\
