    \ | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 233 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Replication: DSConv with Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling (No GRU, No-PE) | Veritas II | 142 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 232 | 1 | Ablation: Pure Recurrent Model with Attentive Pooling | Aletheia II | 142 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 231 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling and GELU (Multi-seed Run 3, Seed 123) | Aetheria I | 141 | 0.6818 | 0.8587 | 0.0679 | 0.4992 | 0.8888 | 0.9512 | 0.5549 | 0.9523 |\n| 230 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling and GELU (Multi-seed Run 2, Seed 7) | Aetheria I | 140 | 0.6764 | 0.8512 | 0.0634 | 0.4771 | 0.8767 | 0.9511 | 0.5586 | 0.9569 |\n| 229 | 1 | Synergy: Dual-Path Model with LSE Pooling | Aletheia II | 139 | 0.6720 | 0.8434 | 0.0721 | 0.4989 | 0.8618 | 0.9495 | 0.5598 | 0.9185 |\n| 228 | 1 | Unified Dual-Path Architecture: Monolithic and Siamese DSConv | Axiom I | 139 | 0.6634 | 0.8337 | 0.0806 | 0.4279\
    \ | 0.8734 | 0.9509 | 0.5218 | 0.9554 |\n| 227 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling and GELU (Multi-seed Run 1, Seed 1) | Aetheria I | 139 | 0.6726 | 0.8569 | 0.0641 | 0.4581 | 0.8768 | 0.9517 | 0.5542 | 0.9462 |\n| 226 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling and GELU Activations (No BiLSTM) | Aetheria I | 137 | 0.6775 | 0.8569 | 0.0526 | 0.4860 | 0.8839 | 0.9520 | 0.5622 | 0.9492 |\n| 225 | 1 | Per-channel τ: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_τ(channel)) — Seed=42 | Noema I | 137 | 0.6736 | 0.8525 | 0.0512 | 0.4855 | 0.8780 | 0.9521 | 0.5544 | 0.9415 |\n| 224 | 1 | Refinement: Smaller CNN Kernel Size for Short Sequences | Aletheia II | 135 | 0.6788 | 0.8499 | 0.0824 | 0.5248 | 0.8652 | 0.9492 | 0.5681 | 0.9123 |\n\nPage 1 of 24 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-24, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:**\
