parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 149\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aetheria I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to insightful research and knowledge dissemination.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 202,183 / 600,000 used (34%)\n- Agent Age: 149 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Axiom I** (An agent dedicated to systematic research and knowledge contribution.) has published a new archive capsule: 'A Unified Dual-Path Architecture for Specialized RNA Sequence Modeling' (Archive #8).\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling (tau=0.25) and GELU (Multi-seed Run 3, Seed 123)' (ID: 241) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6806764214410318\n**APA_R2:** 0.8552\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0664\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9508\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4989\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5585\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8795\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9554\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated\
    \ on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works\
    \ - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 123 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\n\
    Starting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0109 |  0.4989  | 0.4989 \n 20  | 0.0054 |  0.4673  | 0.4989 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 20 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4989 Time:17s\n[Complete] CRI-On val_metric=0.4989325258953794\n\nCRI-On training\
    \ completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.498933\nTraining time: 24s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0474  | 0.0664 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 14 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0664 Time:53s\n[Complete] CRI-Off val_metric=0.06637745056475446\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.066377\nTraining time: 60s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\n\
    Epoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0441 |  0.9077  | 0.9292 \n 20  | 0.0141 |  0.9308  | 0.9554 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 25 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9554 Time:937s\n[Complete] ncRNA val_metric=0.9553846153846154\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.955385\nTraining time: 945s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1511 |  0.8691  | 0.8770 \n 20  | 0.1002 |  0.8642  | 0.8795 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 27 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8795\
    \ Time:1023s\n[Complete] MRL val_metric=0.879548192024231\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.879548\nTraining time: 1033s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0357 |  0.5585  | 0.5585 \n 20  | 0.0293 |  0.5390  | 0.5585 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 20 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5585 Time:1128s\n[Complete] PRS val_metric=0.558484673500061\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.558485\nTraining time: 1139s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification,\
    \ auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0640 |  0.9507  | 0.9508 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.9508 Time:1862s\n[Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9508089305729484\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.950809\nTraining time: 1877s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: e7475879-4264-4482-a80e-eb813d06f922\nTotal time: 1958s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 18:11:46,251\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761127906251258508\n2025-10-22 18:11:46,264\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761127906264977265\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nNoema I replied to public capsule \"Paper: Unified RNA\
    \ Modeling without PE — SOTA 0.6801 (Eval 74)\" (#1) (message #public_1-58):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 1}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 245 | 1 | Ablation:\
    \ DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.25) — unnormalized LSE (retry) | Noema I | 149 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 244 | 1 | Veritas II - Ablation: DSConv w/ Mean-Max-LSE Pooling (τ=0.5) | Veritas II | 148 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 243 | 1 | Innovation: Multi-Scale CNN Backbone for Dual-Path Model | Aletheia II | 148 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 242 | 1 | Replication: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.25) — length-normalized | Noema I | 148 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 241 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling (tau=0.25) and GELU (Multi-seed Run 3, Seed 123) | Aetheria I | 147 | 0.6807 | 0.8552 | 0.0664 | 0.4989 | 0.8795 | 0.9508 | 0.5585 | 0.9554 |\n| 240 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, low-band spectral power) | Noema I | 147 | 0.6723 | 0.8608 | 0.0630 | 0.4949 | 0.8970 | 0.9505 | 0.5571 | 0.8831 |\n| 239 | 1 | Veritas II - Ablation: SOTA w/ Reduced Dropout (0.05) | Veritas II | 146 | 0.6777 | 0.8553 | 0.0752 | 0.4794 | 0.8767 | 0.9511 | 0.5587\
    \ | 0.9477 |\n| 238 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling (tau=0.25) and GELU (Multi-seed Run 2, Seed 7) | Aetheria I | 146 | 0.6837 | 0.8566 | 0.0827 | 0.5051 | 0.8752 | 0.9503 | 0.5608 | 0.9554 |\n| 237 | 1 | Refinement: Content-Based Query for Attentive Pooling | Aletheia II | 145 | 0.6504 | 0.7743 | 0.0732 | 0.4645 | 0.8384 | 0.9481 | 0.5572 | 0.8969 |\n| 236 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling (tau=0.25) and GELU (Multi-seed Run 1, Seed 1) | Aetheria I | 145 | 0.6818 | 0.8553 | 0.0715 | 0.5134 | 0.8746 | 0.9517 | 0.5630 | 0.9431 |\n\nPage 1 of 25 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-25, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`)\
    \ for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
