    Early stop at epoch 37 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9508 Time:1389s\n[Complete] ncRNA val_metric=0.9507692307692308\nLearned tau not found in params (likely not yet trained or not learnable).\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.950769\nTraining time: 1397s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0351 |  0.5310  | 0.5557 \n 20  | 0.0288 |  0.5231  | 0.5567 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 25 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5567 Time:1390s\n[Complete] PRS val_metric=0.5566934943199158\nLearned tau not found in params (likely\
