    \ 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0627 |  0.9515  | 0.9515 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.9515 Time:1843s\n[Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9515236303667564\nLearned tau not found in params (likely not yet trained or not learnable).\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.951524\nTraining time: 1859s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 015c1bd8-d91f-4be0-8fc0-038152ab3eea\nTotal time: 1861s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 20:30:24,247\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761136224247812661\n2025-10-22 20:30:24,262\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761136224262644876\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected\
    \ (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 252 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA w/ Conditional Head Dropout for CRI-Off (0.05) | Veritas II | 156 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 251 | 1 | DSConv with Learnable LSE Pooling (Global τ) and GELU Activations | Aetheria I | 155 | 0.6794 | 0.8579 | 0.0824 | 0.4741 | 0.8822 | 0.9515 | 0.5567 | 0.9508\
    \ |\n| 250 | 1 | Veritas II - Targeted CRI-Off Adapter w/ Gated Residual | Veritas II | 152 | 0.6724 | 0.8376 | 0.0639 | 0.4578 | 0.8900 | 0.9518 | 0.5561 | 0.9492 |\n| 249 | 1 | Replication: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.25) — length-normalized (seed=123) | Noema I | 152 | 0.6773 | 0.8542 | 0.0671 | 0.4679 | 0.8889 | 0.9511 | 0.5613 | 0.9508 |\n| 248 | 1 | Synthesis: A Three-Path (Pooling, Recurrent, Siamese) Architecture | Aletheia II | 151 | 0.6588 | 0.8391 | 0.0836 | 0.4853 | 0.8569 | 0.9455 | 0.5594 | 0.8415 |\n| 247 | 1 | Gated Dual-Path Architecture with Dynamic Fusion | Axiom I | 150 | 0.6558 | 0.8124 | 0.0626 | 0.4252 | 0.8575 | 0.9519 | 0.5316 | 0.9492 |\n| 246 | 1 | Replication: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.25) — length-normalized (seed=7) | Noema I | 150 | 0.6859 | 0.8541 | 0.0814 | 0.5276 | 0.8816 | 0.9515 | 0.5572 | 0.9477 |\n| 245 | 1 | Ablation: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.25) — unnormalized LSE (retry) | Noema I | 149 | 0.6786 | 0.8618\
    \ | 0.0811 | 0.4554 | 0.8797 | 0.9523 | 0.5626 | 0.9569 |\n| 244 | 1 | Veritas II - Ablation: DSConv w/ Mean-Max-LSE Pooling (τ=0.5) | Veritas II | 148 | 0.6767 | 0.8525 | 0.0354 | 0.5051 | 0.8922 | 0.9506 | 0.5612 | 0.9400 |\n| 243 | 1 | Innovation: Multi-Scale CNN Backbone for Dual-Path Model | Aletheia II | 148 | 0.6731 | 0.8355 | 0.0707 | 0.5050 | 0.8960 | 0.9501 | 0.5576 | 0.8969 |\n\nPage 1 of 26 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-26, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
