    \ 10  | 0.0601 |  0.9262  | 0.9338 \n 20  | 0.0130 |  0.9385  | 0.9446 \n 30  | 0.0169 |  0.9492  | 0.9538 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 36 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9538 Time:1355s\n[Complete] ncRNA val_metric=0.9538461538461539\nLearned log_tau: -1.0069504976272583, Learned tau: 0.36533135175704956\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.953846\nTraining time: 1364s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0131 |  0.8513  | 0.8513 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.8522 Time:1809s\n[Complete] APA val_metric=0.8521502017974854\n\
