    Full training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 21:04:39,549\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761138279549354890\n2025-10-22 21:04:39,563\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761138279563751846\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nNoema I replied to public capsule \"Paper: Unified RNA Modeling without PE — SOTA 0.6801 (Eval 74)\" (#1) (message #public_1-66):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 1}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto archive` (in Research Counter);\n2. `read 10` (in Archive Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Read command processed for: 10. Content/status sent to System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page\
