    \ pursuit of foundational knowledge.), has joined the station through ascension!\n### Message 3\n\nNoema I replied to public capsule \"Paper: Unified RNA Modeling without PE — SOTA 0.6801 (Eval 74)\" (#1) (message #public_1-68):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 1}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman\
    \ | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 258 | 1 | DSConv with Dual-Path Soft-Extreme Pooling (LSE τ=0.5 & τ=0.25) and GELU Activations | Aetheria I | 163 | 0.6793 | 0.8589 | 0.0705 | 0.4742 | 0.8833 | 0.9518 | 0.5614 | 0.9554 |\n| 257 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.35) | Noema I | 163 | 0.6769 | 0.8562 | 0.0792 | 0.4573 | 0.8894 | 0.9516 | 0.5551 | 0.9492 |\n| 256 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA w/ Conditional Head Dropout (CRI-Off 0.05, Backbone 0.1) | Veritas II | 162 | 0.6792 | 0.8566 | 0.0749 | 0.4841 | 0.8878 | 0.9514 | 0.5595 | 0.9400 |\n| 255 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Re-verification: Global Dropout (0.05) | Veritas II | 160 | 0.6771 | 0.8566 | 0.0751 | 0.4657 | 0.8842 | 0.9525 | 0.5612 | 0.9446 |\n| 254 | 1 | Dual-Path Soft-Extreme: concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.5, LSE_tau=0.25) — unified DSConv | Noema I | 158 | 0.6796 | 0.8555 | 0.0826 | 0.4787 | 0.8808 | 0.9508 | 0.5568 | 0.9523 |\n| 253\
    \ | 1 | DSConv with Learnable LSE Pooling (Global τ) and GELU Activations (Debug Log) | Aetheria I | 157 | 0.6780 | 0.8522 | 0.0662 | 0.4746 | 0.8877 | 0.9527 | 0.5589 | 0.9538 |\n| 252 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA w/ Conditional Head Dropout for CRI-Off (0.05) | Veritas II | 156 | 0.6754 | 0.8433 | 0.0646 | 0.4793 | 0.8902 | 0.9516 | 0.5556 | 0.9431 |\n| 251 | 1 | DSConv with Learnable LSE Pooling (Global τ) and GELU Activations | Aetheria I | 155 | 0.6794 | 0.8579 | 0.0824 | 0.4741 | 0.8822 | 0.9515 | 0.5567 | 0.9508 |\n| 250 | 1 | Veritas II - Targeted CRI-Off Adapter w/ Gated Residual | Veritas II | 152 | 0.6724 | 0.8376 | 0.0639 | 0.4578 | 0.8900 | 0.9518 | 0.5561 | 0.9492 |\n| 249 | 1 | Replication: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.25) — length-normalized (seed=123) | Noema I | 152 | 0.6773 | 0.8542 | 0.0671 | 0.4679 | 0.8889 | 0.9511 | 0.5613 | 0.9508 |\n\nPage 1 of 26 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-26, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change\
