    Best:0.5579 Time:1397s\n[Complete] PRS val_metric=0.5578629970550537\nError accessing gate parameters in complete: 'RNANetGatedDualLSE_0'\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.557863\nTraining time: 1408s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0681 |  0.9495  | 0.9495 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.9507 Time:1882s\n[Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9507232370466117\nError accessing gate parameters in complete: 'RNANetGatedDualLSE_0'\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.950723\nTraining time: 1901s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 3ced6d18-a562-425b-bac9-112b9ef96ab0\n\
