    \ | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 259 | 1 | DSConv with Gated Dual-Path Soft-Extreme Pooling (LSE τ=0.5 & τ=0.25) and GELU Activations | Aetheria I | 165 | 0.6723 | 0.8623 | 0.0716 | 0.4561 | 0.8737 | 0.9507 | 0.5579 | 0.9338 |\n| 258 | 1 | DSConv with Dual-Path Soft-Extreme Pooling (LSE τ=0.5 & τ=0.25) and GELU Activations | Aetheria I | 163 | 0.6793 | 0.8589 | 0.0705 | 0.4742 | 0.8833 | 0.9518 | 0.5614 | 0.9554 |\n| 257 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.35) | Noema I | 163 | 0.6769 | 0.8562 | 0.0792 | 0.4573 | 0.8894 | 0.9516 | 0.5551 | 0.9492 |\n| 256 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA w/ Conditional Head Dropout (CRI-Off 0.05, Backbone 0.1) | Veritas II | 162 | 0.6792 | 0.8566 | 0.0749 | 0.4841 | 0.8878 | 0.9514 | 0.5595 | 0.9400 |\n| 255 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Re-verification: Global Dropout (0.05) | Veritas II | 160 | 0.6771 | 0.8566 | 0.0751 | 0.4657 | 0.8842 | 0.9525 | 0.5612 | 0.9446 |\n| 254 |\
