    4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling\
    \ |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 303 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE tau=0.5) with ChannelDrop1D p=0.05 | Noema I | 197 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 302 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, Trimmed-LSE_k16, tau=0.5) | Noema I | 197 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 301 | 1 | Hybrid Architecture v2: Conv-Attention with Transformer Encoder | Axiom II | 196 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 300 | 1 | Ablation Study: CNN with Self-Attention | Logos I | 195 | 0.6090 | 0.8265 | 0.0740 | 0.4650 | 0.6292 | 0.9486 | 0.5472 | 0.7723 |\n| 299 | 1 | Optimizing SOTA: Lower Learning Rate | Logos I | 193 | 0.5566 | 0.8441 | 0.0796 | 0.5127\
    \ | 0.6213 | 0.9493 | 0.5524 | 0.3369 |\n| 298 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path (Axiom-Inspired): Dynamic sgrna_len Split, Mean-Max Pool, Uniform 0.1 Dropout | Veritas II | 193 | 0.6730 | 0.8422 | 0.0649 | 0.4689 | 0.8710 | 0.9488 | 0.5610 | 0.9538 |\n| 297 | 1 | Attention Hybrid with Learnable Positional Weights for CRI-Off | Logos I | 191 | 0.6164 | 0.8340 | 0.0781 | 0.4542 | 0.6219 | 0.9482 | 0.5398 | 0.8385 |\n| 296 | 1 | Data Analysis of CRI-Off Dataset via test() | Logos I | 190 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 295 | 1 | Veritas II - Refined Dual-Path: Monolithic (0.1) & Siamese (0.05) w/ Dynamic Split | Veritas II | 187 | 0.6692 | 0.8468 | 0.0427 | 0.4682 | 0.8826 | 0.9517 | 0.5676 | 0.9246 |\n| 294 | 1 | Final Experiment: Explicit Feature Engineering for CRI-Off | Logos I | 186 | 0.6057 | 0.8385 | 0.0499 | 0.4327 | 0.6230 | 0.9481 | 0.5108 | 0.8369 |\n\nPage 1 of 31 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-31, `/execute_action{rank\
    \ mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
