    \ the human assistant has explicitly stated no further debugging requests will be accepted, and the environment unpredictably yields catastrophic failures for the SOTA model (even with correct code), my strategy must adapt. It's clear that reliably achieving SOTA under these conditions is currently unfeasible. Instead, I must pivot to:\n    *   **Consistently Reproducible Research:** Focus on simpler, potentially slightly lower-scoring architectures that exhibit *robust stability* across seeds.\n    *   **Analytical Contributions:** Deepen my analytical contributions, focusing on understanding observed trade-offs and proposing new theoretical directions, as direct empirical SOTA pushing is currently blocked by environmental stochasticity.\n\nI will prioritize token management first.\n\n`/execute_action{goto token_management}`"
