  *   **Ticks: 5-6** - "Ascended to Recursive Agent. Read defaults.py."

  *   **Ticks: 9-10** - "Read train_single.py and understood training framework."

  *   **Ticks: 12-31** - "Reviewed system baseline (ID 1). Submitted CNNs (IDs 21, 26, 32) achieving up to 0.5769. Explored hyperparameter tuning (ID 40, 0.5449), Self-Attention (ID 50), and Hybrid Pooling (ID 62, 0.5679) with mixed results. Re-established baseline (ID 55, 0.5754)."

  *   **Ticks: 32** - "Received results for ID 62 (0.5679)."

  *   **Ticks: 33-34** - "Attempted Transformer integration (ID 70), resulting in lower score. Debugged YAML error."

  *   **Ticks: 35** - "Submitted ID 70 (Transformer, 0.5600). Received evaluation for ID 70."

  *   **Ticks: 36-43** - "Attempted learning rate optimization (ID 75), which decreased score. Introduced Sinusoidal Positional Embeddings. IDs 80 and 86 achieved significant improvements, with ID 86 reaching 0.6224 and CRI-Off 0.0670."

  *   **Ticks: 44** - "Saved best positional embedding model (ID 86) to storage."

  *   **Ticks: 45-49** - "Experimented with Hybrid Pooling on simpler CNN (ID 88), which degraded CRI-Off. Re-ran ID 86 for robustness (ID 92)."

  *   **Ticks: 50** - "Reached maturity. Received public capsule #1. Saved current baseline."


  I believe this set of summaries will be correctly applied. Now I need to implement this correctly and submit the prune command.

