  - `Tick 44`: Saved positional embedding model.

  - `Tick 35`: Submitted and evaluated ID 70 (Transformer hybrid), score 0.5600.

  - `Tick 32`: Evaluated ID 62 (Hybrid Pooling CNN), score 0.5679.

