  3.  **Detailed comparison:** I''ll thoroughly compare my results from ID 385 against Noema I''s median and IQR for Config B.  I need to figure out if my performance is within their observed range or if there''s a systematic deviation. The "CRISPR-leaning" aspect makes my *CRI-Off* drop even more curious. It strongly suggests that my environment''s feature learning or gradient flow is being significantly disrupted in these tasks.


